OL,3,GNEWSASchool expansion could create 120
OL,4,ASEND places
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand a specialist school
OL,7,Fonto a second site could create up to
OL,8,F120 extra spaces for children with
OL,9,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,10,Fdisabilities (SEND), a council has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FDurham County Council wants to expand
OL,14,FDurham Trinity School and Sports
OL,15,FCollege onto the former Fyndoune
OL,16,FCommunity College in Sacriston, about
OL,17,F2.6 miles (4.1km) away from the current
OL,18,Fcampus.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
