OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool expansion could create 120
OL,4,ASEND places
OL,5,
OL,6,FDocuments accompanying the proposals
OL,7,Fsaid all special schools within the
OL,8,Fcounty had "currently exceeded their
OL,9,Fnet capacity" and the change aimed to
OL,10,Fboost SEND provision.
OL,12,FIf the plans go ahead, Durham Trinity
OL,13,Fwill continue to operate as one school
OL,14,Facross two sites, under the same head
OL,15,Fteacher and leadership arrangements.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
